<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Conquest for Discipline Priest Healer Phase 2</h3>As mentioned above, getting your T8 set bonus is your priority at the start of Phase 2, which is why buying both of the 25m tokens first is a no-brainer.<br/>There isn't a noticeable difference between the two in terms of stat gains compared to the previous phase bis, so which order you purchase them in doesn't matter.<br/>
<br/>Unfortunately, the other items you can trade your conquest emblems in for are fairly underwhelming. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45831/sash-of-potent-incantations">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sash of Potent Incantations</span></a> is decent but not quite as good as the crafted belt. <br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45848/legwraps-of-the-master-conjurer">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legwraps of the Master Conjurer</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45840/touch-of-the-occult">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Touch of the Occult</span></a> are slight upgrades over previous phase items but occupy slots you technically want to fill with tier pieces and are not powerful enough to be worth using as your offpiece.<br/>
<br/>Finally, the necklace is roughly as good as the Malygos 25m quest necklace, which can now be obtained in the 10m instance as well. Not really worth spending badges on unless you already bought everything and could still make use of it.<br/>
