<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Discipline Priest Healer Phase 2</h3>While this set piece has the least possible ways to be obtained, it's still worth going for nonetheless. Even more so when you consider that the 10m token still outperforms every other shoulder armor in this phase and the previous one when it comes to individual stats due to the high item level.<br/>
<br/>However, this slot also has a great offpiece option in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46068/amice-of-inconceivable-horror">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amice of Inconceivable Horror</span></a> that serves as a possible alternative to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45520/handwraps-of-the-vigilant">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_71.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Handwraps of the Vigilant</span></a>. It gives you slightly higher spell power but provides haste rating instead of critical rating, as well as less intellect and stamina.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50336/greater-inscription-of-the-crag">
