<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Discipline Priest Healer Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40432/illustration-of-the-dragon-soul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_hyjal_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Illustration of the Dragon Soul</span></a> is still your top trinket choice and will most likely last you all the way until Heroic ICC, or even further, but can now also be obtained from the ten-man version of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4493/the-obsidian-sanctum">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Obsidian Sanctum</span></a>. That means you should try to run it every single reset until you get it, simply bring along some guildmates after your main raid to clear it within a couple minutes.<br/>
<br/>Luckily, Ulduar also brings along some other decent spell power trinket options, which are great choices to run alongside your Illustration, with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45535/show-of-faith">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_improvedresistanceauras.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Show of Faith</span></a> being the recommended secondary pick. <br/>
<br/>Finally, there are three decent regeneration trinkets as well but with proper <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47537/rapture">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_rapture.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rapture</span></a> management and good spell usage, you shouldn't need to use any of them. <br/>If you do still want to pick them up just in case, make sure to pass <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46051/meteorite-crystal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_dungeon_ulduarraid_misc_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Meteorite Crystal</span></a> to your Holy Paladin and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45703/spark-of-hope">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_invisibilitytotem.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spark of Hope</span></a> to your Restoration Druid before doing so, as they benefit significantly more from these trinkets.<div class="pad"></div>
