<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Discipline Priest Healer Phase 2</h2>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-and-two-handed-weapons-for-discipline-priest-healer-phase-2">Main and Two-Handed Weapons for Discipline Priest Healer Phase 2</h4>As a Discipline Priest, you gain less benefit from <a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46017/valanyr-hammer-of-ancient-kings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_99.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Val'anyr, Hammer of Ancient Kings</span></a> because most of your casts are shields, which can only trigger the effect via the glyph, making the proc significantly less valuable for you compared to other healer specs. There is the misguided argument that you could simply switch to hardcasting <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=48072/prayer-of-healing">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_prayerofhealing02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Prayer of Healing</span></a> while it is active, but that simply goes against the reason why Discipline is so valued in a healer roster, which is the fact that shielding is almost completely independent of your others healers allowing you to easily synergize with them.<br/>
<br/>Instead <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45612/constellus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Constellus</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45457/staff-of-endless-winter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_94.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Endless Winter</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46035/aesuga-hand-of-the-ardent-champion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Aesuga, Hand of the Ardent Champion</span></a> are excellent alternatives that will serve you nearly as well in practice.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60714/enchant-weapon-mighty-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Mighty Spellpower</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=62948/enchant-staff-greater-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Staff - Greater Spellpower</span></a>
